// ref px on 26 = 0.08 x height, i.e. a different family
// entirely. x1.33 ⇒ 2.7, and E01 says "radius about 3".
// Scoped to the timed chip ONLY - the all-day pill keeps
// row/3 and A01/A03 stay closed on it.
